Subject: phy: wire up the al_serdes 25G/10GBASE-R driver

Tree: /mnt/2tb/unvr-port-refs/u-boot-v2026.07 (UBOOT_TREE)
Issue: #224

The obj line goes in drivers/Makefile, NOT drivers/phy/Makefile: the latter
is only descended into when CONFIG_PHY=y, and we do not need the PHY uclass.
The Kconfig is sourced from drivers/phy/Kconfig, which drivers/Kconfig
always sources.

drivers/phy/al_serdes/ is copied in from uboot-port/ by
scripts/uboot-build.py.

Was: DRIVERS_MAKE_LINE / PHY_KCONFIG_LINE txt.replace() in
scripts/uboot-build.py, guarded by a hand-written DRIVERS_MK_SANITY check
against truncated files (#102). git apply's own context matching replaces
that guard.

diff --git a/drivers/Makefile b/drivers/Makefile
index 43d0ba33..0dec9bd9 100644
--- a/drivers/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/Makefile
@@ -135,3 +135,4 @@ obj-$(CONFIG_$(PHASE_)DM_RNG) += rng/
 endif
 
 obj-y += soc/
+obj-$(CONFIG_AL_SERDES) += phy/al_serdes/
diff --git a/drivers/phy/Kconfig b/drivers/phy/Kconfig
index 5c8ec2b1..9f1c71bc 100644
--- a/drivers/phy/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/phy/Kconfig
@@ -358,4 +358,6 @@ config PHY_COMMON_PROPS
 	  drivers to read polarity and other standard PHY properties from the
 	  device tree node.
 
+source "drivers/phy/al_serdes/Kconfig"
+
 endmenu
